sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Person as Person
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Person: correctIdentity(givenName, familyName, phone)
    Note over Person: Policies: personRead, personWrite, personExecute
    Note over Person: Guards (2)
    Person->>Person: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    Person->>Person: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Person->>Person: mutate.givenName
    Person->>Person: mutate.familyName
    Person->>Person: mutate.phone
    Person->>EventBus: emit PersonIdentityCorrected on person.identity_corrected
    Person-->>-Client: void